      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1190474611719304,
        "y0": 0.6418561805042078,
        "x1": 0.9090659613875868,
        "y1": 0.6537342168272429
      },
      "text": "nas alegações judiciais foram relacionados à cirurgia e a complicações perinatais, sendo que as três",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1190474611719304,
        "y0": 0.6608610386210639,
        "x1": 0.9090542726787987,
        "y1": 0.672739074944099
      },
      "text": "especialidades mais arroladas nas alegações judiciais foram obstetrícia, ortopedia e medicina de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1190474611719304,
        "y0": 0.6798658967379201,
        "x1": 0.2914380879510749,
        "y1": 0.6917439330609552
      },
      "text": "emergência (HWANG",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.291452032375594,
        "y0": 0.6798658967379201,
        "x1": 0.3253522869374616,
        "y1": 0.6917439330609552
      },
      "text": "et al",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.32535177427479545,
